WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.199
- So...
(audience clapping)

00:00:01.199 --> 00:00:03.750
On tour, you saw me,
or they're right here.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.583
They're In-Ears.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.416
We call them In-Ears.

00:00:05.416 --> 00:00:06.357
But you can decorate them.
- Ah-ha.

00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:08.250
- And I go gold, sparkly, seventies.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.083
- [Olivia] Cute.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:10.560
- But you have photos on yours.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.501
I didn't know you could do photos.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:12.680
- (gasps) Yeah, you can put photos.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.770
- No one told me this.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.100
- Yeah, you put photos of your
kids, put photos of anyone.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.278
Those are mine.
(audience cheering)

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:19.037
- Edward Cullen.
- Edward.

00:00:19.037 --> 00:00:20.280
That's my baby.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.780
Like, that's my thing, yeah.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.710
- I'm a "Twilight" nerd.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.181
- That's Edward Cullen on my In-Ears.

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:27.106
- Yes, yes.
(audience cheering)

00:00:27.106 --> 00:00:28.397
And a nice purple lavender.

00:00:28.397 --> 00:00:29.230
I like that, too.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.450
- Yeah, he's my guiding light on tour.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.560
You know, just to have to have

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.450
my lucky charm.
- As he should be, yeah.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.470
- Yeah, love him.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.060
- What's on your In-Ears now?

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.680
- My In-Ears now for this "Guts" tour...

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.450
I'm gonna get a new face every tour,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:40.770
so taking suggestions

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.603
for the next one.
- Okay.

00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:42.436
- Maybe I'll put you on my next one.

00:00:42.436 --> 00:00:43.488
- Okay.
(audience cheering)

00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:45.077
- Aim for like something random.

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:46.923
- (laughing) Yeah.
- Like Betty White.

00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:47.756
- (claps) Yeah!

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:48.877
- Like, just something random, right?

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:50.040
That makes you happy.
- Yeah, but this year it's...

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:50.873
- Totally.

00:00:50.873 --> 00:00:51.781
- Oh, it's Kim Cattrall!

00:00:51.781 --> 00:00:52.761
- Yeah, it's Kim Cattrall.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:55.435
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:55.435 --> 00:00:56.333
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:57.900
- It's Kim Cattrall
from "Sex and the City."

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:58.890
Samantha from "Sex and the City."

00:00:58.890 --> 00:00:59.723
She's my favorite.

00:00:59.723 --> 00:01:01.260
And she's, like, drinking
a little martini,

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.130
and I thought it was great.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:03.150
- Why not?
- Why not?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:03.983
- You know what that says?

00:01:03.983 --> 00:01:04.816
"Celebrate."
- Yeah.

00:01:04.816 --> 00:01:05.649
- Every time you put your In-Ears in.

00:01:05.649 --> 00:01:06.965
I like it.
- Uh-huh.

00:01:06.965 --> 00:01:07.798
- I think I did know you could do photos.

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:08.631
Do you have Rue?

00:01:08.631 --> 00:01:10.020
Do you have Rue on yours?

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:10.853
Oh, okay.

00:01:10.853 --> 00:01:11.686
Her dog.

00:01:11.686 --> 00:01:12.637
I was like,

00:01:12.637 --> 00:01:13.470
"Maybe I have seen photos."
- Oh, cute.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.060
- [Kelly] I know, I need to be cooler.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.970
I'm gonna aim higher.
- Next time.

